\begin{frame}{Are Creoles and Cajuns racialized?}
  The evidence here suggests that they are
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item Common statements about Creoles and Cajuns being Black and White are supported \smallcite{eble_creole_2008, klingler_language_2003}
    \item Creoles and Cajuns are racialized in the context of a larger racialized social system
    \begin{itemize}
      \item A case of fractal recursivity \smallcite{irvine_language_2000}
    \end{itemize}
    \item The sociological framework of racialization and racialized social system \smallcite{bonilla-silva_rethinking_1997, omi_racial_2015} provides a theoretical context that ties all the parts together
  \end{enumerate}
\end{frame}